                "insert": "mismatch_signature",
                "attributes": {
                  "code": true
                }
              }
            ],
            "A diff shape that keeps appearing between matched and unmatched assembly, and the source shape that produces it",
            "Two stores swapped in the epilogue whenever a local is written after a call"
